# Web SPA prod env stub (owned by web-fsd-rework — DEC-002 / DEC-008).
#
# No custom VITE_* keys are required. The SPA uses only Vite built-ins:
#   - import.meta.env.BASE_URL — BrowserRouter basename ("/" — login at root)
#   - import.meta.env.DEV — false in production build; API via nginx → Nest
#
# Compose `web` loads this file via env_file so the path exists. An empty
# key list is valid. Runtime env_file does NOT rewrite baked static assets.
#
# Before prod compose, copy:
#   copy web\.env.prod.example web\.env.prod   (Windows)
#   cp web/.env.prod.example web/.env.prod     (Unix)
#
# Prod: docker compose -f docker-compose.yml -f docker-compose.prod.yml up -d --build
# API/db secrets live in backend/.env.prod —
# see ../backend/.env.prod.example.
